  "point.organeffects.organ_stat.organeffects.oxygen_efficiency": "供氧效率",
  "point.organeffects.organ_stat.organeffects.oxygen_efficiency.desc": "呼吸系统的整体供氧能力。每 10 tick 额外恢复氧气，延长水下停留时间，并加快脱离缺氧后的恢复。",
  "point.organeffects.organ_stat.organeffects.cardiac_output": "心输出量",
  "point.organeffects.organ_stat.organeffects.cardiac_output.desc": "心脏与循环系统的泵血能力。每点提供 0.5 点最大生命，并在饱食时更频繁地回复生命。",
  "point.organeffects.organ_stat.organeffects.liver_detox_efficiency": "肝脏解毒效率",
  "point.organeffects.organ_stat.organeffects.liver_detox_efficiency.desc": "肝脏清除异常状态的能力。每秒缩短负面效果持续时间，使中毒、凋零等 debuff 更快结束。",
  "point.organeffects.organ_stat.organeffects.kidney_filtration_efficiency": "肾脏过滤效率",
  "point.organeffects.organ_stat.organeffects.kidney_filtration_efficiency.desc": "肾脏处理毒性残留的能力。显著缩短中毒和凋零持续时间；若数值为负，则会周期性给自己施加中毒。",
  "point.organeffects.organ_stat.organeffects.digestive_absorption": "消化吸收效率",
  "point.organeffects.organ_stat.organeffects.digestive_absorption.desc": "将食物转化为营养的效率。进食后会根据该数值额外获得饱食度和饱和度。",
  "point.organeffects.organ_stat.organeffects.immune_efficiency": "免疫效率",
  "point.organeffects.organ_stat.organeffects.immune_efficiency.desc": "免疫系统对外来异常的清理速度。可以直接抵抗新的负面效果，并在未受 debuff 干扰时提供小幅恢复脉冲。",
  "point.organeffects.organ_stat.organeffects.neural_conduction": "神经传导",
  "point.organeffects.organ_stat.organeffects.neural_conduction.desc": "神经信号传递速度。每点提供 0.08 攻击速度和 12% 挖掘速度；若数值为负，会出现类似瘫痪的迟缓与挖掘疲劳。",
  "point.organeffects.organ_stat.organeffects.muscular_strength": "肌力",
  "point.organeffects.organ_stat.organeffects.muscular_strength.desc": "肌肉系统的力量输出。每点提供 0.75 攻击伤害、2 点拉弓蓄力，以及 4% 箭矢初速度，但会受到弓的配置速度上限限制。",
  "point.organeffects.organ_stat.organeffects.end_crystal_resonance": "末地水晶共鸣",
  "point.organeffects.organ_stat.organeffects.end_crystal_resonance.desc": "像末影龙一样与附近末地水晶建立共鸣。受伤时会周期性从周围水晶抽取能量恢复生命。",
  "point.organeffects.skill.organeffects.wonder_sight": "奇迹视界",
  "point.organeffects.skill.organeffects.wonder_sight.desc": "授予奇迹视界主动技能。",
  "point.organeffects.skill.organeffects.water_breathing": "水下呼吸",
  "point.organeffects.skill.organeffects.water_breathing.desc": "授予一个可主动使用的水下呼吸技能。",
  "point.organeffects.skill.organeffects.double_jump": "二段跳",
  "point.organeffects.skill.organeffects.double_jump.desc": "授予空中再次跳跃的技能。",
  "point.organeffects.skill.organeffects.end_crystal_absorption": "末地水晶吸收",
  "point.organeffects.skill.organeffects.end_crystal_absorption.desc": "授予主动吸收附近末地水晶能量的技能，可回复生命并获得短暂强化。",
  "point.organeffects.skill.organeffects.dragon_breath": "喷吐龙息",
  "point.organeffects.skill.organeffects.dragon_breath.desc": "授予主动喷吐一团持续滞留龙息的技能。",
  "point.organeffects.skill.organeffects.shulker_bolt": "发射潜影弹",
  "point.organeffects.skill.organeffects.shulker_bolt.desc": "授予主动向目标打出一发潜影化冲击的技能，会造成伤害并附带漂浮。",
  "point.organeffects.skill.organeffects.guardian_beam": "守卫者激光",
  "point.organeffects.skill.organeffects.guardian_beam.desc": "授予主动以守卫者风格聚焦灼烧目标的技能，造成伤害并附带减速。",
